Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — individual review draft
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT./EXT. SEPARATE WORKSPACES - NIGHT

Jackie knows her move. Voss knows one signal route. Vale knows the paper contradiction. Zoe knows what she will disclose. Elias knows an escape fallback. No one receives a master plan.

A legacy channel keyed to AC019 carries a narrow message about P06-11803's disputed authority and the old presentation site. A vehicle hire adds a plausible movement. Cain takes the bait and heads toward the assessment centre.

Zoe checks one last time what Jackie has agreed to. Her friend rejects an improvised extraction that could endanger the siblings. The plan exposes a disputed transfer; it does not promise control over the independent response.
